  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mighty assault is also a great defense.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Shield of Swings<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you take a full-attack action while wielding a two-handed weapon modified by Power Attack, you can choose to not deal the additional damage from Power Attack to gain a +4 shield bonus to AC and CMD until the beginning of your next turn. The reduction in damage applies until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Shield of swings functions with or without Power Attack, but halves the damage you deal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
